<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#1F3320', padding: 0 }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', width: 1280, height: 720 }}>
    <Box style={{
      width: 660, height: 720, paddingTop: 66, paddingLeft: 76, paddingRight: 40,
      flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingBottom: 60,
    }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA680', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
          全国大学生计算机应用能力与数字素养大赛 · 第九届传智杯
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA680', letterSpacing: 2, marginTop: 6, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
          AI WEB 网页开发挑战赛 · B 组（本科）
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 44 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 88, background: '#8ABFEB', marginRight: 22 }} />
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 86, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.02, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
              MedAI
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#C6D8B8', marginTop: 8, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
              草地上的绒球医生
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#9DB08E', marginTop: 30, lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          一个账号，管全家人的健康档案。<br />
          把"该吃什么药、该不该去医院、复诊怎么说"，<br />
          放进一片能点开的草地。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 34 }}>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 140 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8ABFEB', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>163</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E9470', marginTop: 3 }}>条科普内容</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 140 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8ABFEB', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>2.7万</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E9470', marginTop: 3 }}>行代码</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 160 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8ABFEB', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>147</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E9470', marginTop: 3 }}>项自检全绿</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{
        flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between',
        borderTop: '1px solid #3C5138', paddingTop: 20,
      }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7E9470', letterSpacing: 1 }}>参赛院校</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E8EFE0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>广东医科大学</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7E9470', letterSpacing: 1 }}>团队成员</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E8EFE0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>陈妍萱 · 潘思妍</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7E9470', letterSpacing: 1 }}>指导教师</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E8EFE0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>白金山</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 620, height: 720, position: 'relative' }}>
      <Image src="assets/home.png" style={{ width: 620, height: 720, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
      <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 200, height: 720,
        backgroundImage: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1F3320 0%, rgba(31,51,32,0) 100%)',
      }} />
      <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute', bottom: 40, right: 32, paddingTop: 10, paddingBottom: 10,
        paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18, background: 'rgba(31,51,32,0.82)', borderRadius: 4,
      }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#D8E4CC', letterSpacing: 1 }}>产品实机界面 · 一个账号管六份家庭档案</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
